    "summary_one_sentence": "When a grieving widowed fisherwoman stumbles upon a teenage girl's kidnapping in remote, snowbound Minnesota, she must rely on her survival skills to rescue the girl and outwit ruthless captors.",
    "summary_short": "Traversing the isolated, frozen wilderness of northern Minnesota, a widowed fisherwoman finds her solo trip upended when she discovers a young girl being held captive. Stranded hours away from civilization with zero cellular signal, she quickly realizes she is the teenager's sole chance at survival. Pushed to her absolute limits against severe winter elements and dangerous criminals, she launches a harrowing rescue mission. The film delivers a tense, high-stakes thriller exploring resilience, survival, and unexpected heroism.",
    "summary_long": "Deep in the unforgiving winter wilderness of northern Minnesota, a grieving widowed fisherwoman seeks solitude on a solitary trip. Her journey takes a dangerous turn when she stumbles across evidence of a violent kidnapping in progress involving a young teenage girl. Stranded miles away from any town and entirely cut off from phone service, she faces a grim reality: calling for help is impossible. Recognizing that the abducted girl will not survive without intervention, the fisherwoman makes a brave choice to track the kidnappers through the dense, snowbound woods. Using her expert knowledge of the terrain and survival skills, she quietly stalk the captors while plotting a way to free the teenager. Every step is a fight against time as sub-zero temperatures and blinding snowstorms threaten to freeze them both. As the kidnappers realize someone is on their trail, a deadly cat-and-mouse game unfolds across the frozen landscape. Ultimately, the fisherwoman must harness every ounce of resourcefulness and physical endurance to outsmart her deadly adversaries and guide the young girl to safety.",
    "synopsis": "Set against the stark and treacherous landscape of northern Minnesota, Dead of Winter is a high-tension thriller about courage, survival, and human connection in the face of extreme danger. The narrative centers on a widowed fisherwoman navigating the remote frozen outdoors alone, searching for peace amid her personal grief. However, her quiet journey is shattered when she unexpectedly interrupts a violent kidnapping operation and discovers a desperate teenage girl held against her will. Far removed from law enforcement and without any cellular reception, she realizes that turning back means certain death for the youngster. Left with no alternative, she thrusts herself into a perilous rescue mission across severe winter terrain, using her wilderness expertise to confront armed captors and harsh natural elements alike.",
